/S /H2
/T (Having launched their Hyperloop project in 2019, Ashwa has consistently demonstrated technical prowess, making it to the finals in past editions of EHW. However, 2024 was a turning point, as the team presented a fully functional prototype, stepping beyond theoretical design into the realm of practical implementation. This marked the culmination of years of research, testing, and unwavering commitment to sustainable high-speed transportation.)
