348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (On Day 2, Ashwa Mobility attended their first expert talk, gaining insights into emerging Hyperloop innovations. They showcased their mechanical subsystem in the finals and participated in a workshop, engaging with international teams to enhance their technical and collaborative skills. Day 3 featured another expert talk and the finals for the Traction Subsystem, where they demonstrated their innovative drive technology. The team also attended a second workshop and gained valuable exposure through presentations by leading teams like Hyperloop UPV and Avishkar Hyperloop.)
/E (On Day 2, Ashwa Mobility attended their first expert talk, gaining insights into emerging Hyperloop innovations. They showcased their mechanical subsystem in the finals and participated in a workshop, engaging with international teams to enhance their technical and collaborative skills. Day 3 featured another expert talk and the finals for the Traction Subsystem, where they demonstrated their innovative drive technology. The team also attended a second workshop and gained valuable exposure through presentations by leading teams like Hyperloop UPV and Avishkar Hyperloop.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
