<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This is where the MoTeC M800, gold box ECU provided by MoTeC comes into play! The MoTeC M800 is called an ECU or Engine Control Unit, and is basically the brain of the entire car. Interfaced with all the sensors ranging from MAP to Brake Pressure sensors, it is able to observe the entire car and presents the entire information that it is provided in the form of hexadecimal format over STD CAN 2.0. )
/E (This is where the MoTeC M800, gold box ECU provided by MoTeC comes into play! The MoTeC M800 is called an ECU or Engine Control Unit, and is basically the brain of the entire car. Interfaced with all the sensors ranging from MAP to Brake Pressure sensors, it is able to observe the entire car and presents the entire information that it is provided in the form of hexadecimal format over STD CAN 2.0. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
